  "body": "Top Floor, Views, Car Park. All for $599,000 in the Heart of Takapuna\r\n\r\n504/74 Anzac Street, Takapuna\r\n\r\nIf you've been watching the one bedroom apartments at 74 /80 Anzac Street (Sargeson Apartments) come up for sale, this is the one you've been waiting for. It's on the top floor, with views, a car park and storage, and at $599,000 buyers who know this building will see straight away how good this offer is.\r\n\r\n**Smart, efficient living**\r\nThis apartment has been designed for maximum use of space, with no hallways. Every square metre works for you, flowing straight into well-proportioned living, dining and kitchen areas that feel open and easy to live in. It's the kind of layout that makes an apartment feel bigger than the floor plan suggests.\r\n\r\n**Your own outdoor room with a view**\r\nStep out onto the deck and take in views to Lake Pupuke and across the Takapuna town centre. Morning coffee, evening drinks or simply watching the town come alive, this is top-floor living at its best.\r\n\r\n**The extras that matter**\r\nIn central Takapuna a car park is gold, and this apartment comes with one, plus storage for the beach gear and everything else you'd rather not keep inside, an additional area for the bikes, apartments offer one or the other. This one has both.\r\n\r\n**Live in the heart of it all**\r\nStep outside and you're right in the middle of Takapuna. Cafes, restaurants, the Sunday market, shopping, Takapuna Beach and Lake Pupuke are all a short walk away, with buses on your doorstep and easy motorway access to the CBD.\r\n\r\n**Who is it for?**\r\nIt suits first home buyers wanting a lock-up-and-leave lifestyle, downsizers after convenience without compromise, and investors wanting a top-floor apartment with the features tenants ask for first.\r\n\r\nTop floor, views, a car park, storage and all for $599,000. \r\nA combination like this doesn't come along often, so call me today to learn more and arrange to view at this weekends open homes.",
